7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nu1BRWePNt8Q7kNvwGOQx84&_nc_oc=AdqDdgUhUMJgYpDtk5Vqi0JTudgp6_PFtKhERhndBrTM7BAdrHj0r9e67sfsCPa3K6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af22sovEZ9C9NtDEvaiyUy8JfS_SThcmG_EhuJXIBA78cQ&oe=69F21761"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_image.png", "id": "1338840764259905", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619071_1338840770926571_6269814051083876380_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zlWcrfauEbAQ7kNvwFOUGPw&_nc_oc=AdrxLxwKxuOfVeQDoxvIgjk-6sj8kjGPdqeyYzht9iuJeMU91Xpkx7KeC9MADY8ROjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2AIwpDzgLy5qhsJa3Xa3LK-ni83ZpaYok0FY5rkAfBEQ&oe=69F21222"}, "display_name": "The Deep: Beyond the Reef", "keywords": ["underwater", "exploration", "adventure"], "long_description": "**Dive into The Deep**, an underwater adventure game based on the acclaimed graphic novel series and award-winning Netflix show. Featuring the original voice cast in an all-new adventure, you play as Ant, youngest member of the Nekton family of explorers. \n\n- Strap into the Vulcan Knight, a prototype aquatic mech \n{1242079381297479}\n- Explore ancient civilizations \n{1981481742613961}\n- Avoid lethal threats \n{681988514933906}\n- Collect artifacts\n{1532313101129389}\n- And stop a lethal contamination that threatens to spread across the entire ocean.\n{1087659246525233}\n{2745496312319488}", "short_description": "Dive into The Deep, an underwater adventure game based on the acclaimed graphic novel series and award-winning Netflix show. Featuring the original voice cast in an all-new adventure, you play as Ant, youngest member of the Nekton family of explorers. Strap into the Vulcan Knight, a prototype aquatic mech, to explore ancient civilizations, avoid lethal threats, collect artifacts, and stop a lethal contamination that threatens to spread across the entire ocean."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_